"start":238,"end":262,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-54caacbcd2021f7c71af","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-17e420d6771535564afd","layer":"original","quote":"其二千石以下，阿纵不如法者〖11〗，皆举奏免之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":267,"end":290,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-5ecfcbab4e6dbb1bd5ff","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-17e420d6771535564afd","layer":"original","quote":"是时天下初复，州郡多不摄〖5〗。逵曰：“州本以御史出监诸郡，以六条诏书察长吏、二千石以下；故其状皆言严能鹰扬，有督察之才〖6〗；不言安静宽仁，有恺悌之德也〖7〗。今长吏慢法〖8〗，盗贼公行；州知而不纠，天下复何取正乎","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":128,"end":236,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-70b710d7e47b5684e217","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-17e420d6771535564afd","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“逵真刺史矣！”布告天下，当以豫州为法。赐爵关内侯","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":291,"end":319,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
